## 3. Spacing Grid Tokens (8pt Grid)

All layout paddings, margins, and gaps must strictly align with the **8-point spatial grid** (`4dp`, `8dp`, `16dp`, `24dp`, `32dp`).

<Tabs>
  <TabItem label="Android (Compose)">

```kotlin
// File: core/designsystem/theme/Spacing.kt
package com.enterprise.mobile.core.designsystem.theme

import androidx.compose.ui.unit.Dp
import androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp

object Spacing {
  val xs: Dp = 4.dp
  val sm: Dp = 8.dp
  val md: Dp = 16.dp
  val lg: Dp = 24.dp
  val xl: Dp = 32.dp
}
